  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 579eb66038bb3954284ad438592184d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueLine_question1-dreamsElaboration
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _speaker: You
  _scene: 0
  _recollection: {fileID: 0}
  _lines:
  - 'Lately, I''ve been having extremely vivid dreams. To be frank, half the time
    I''m not sure if they''re just dreams or if they''re memories. '
  - 'It''s been messing with my head, if I''m honest. '
  - Even when I'm awake it feels like at any moment I might wake up. I've started
    keepign track of the time and counting my fingers to check.
  - I guess I just wanted someone I could talk it out with. So I could go through
    some of my recollections and determine if they're real or not.
